    },
    "KeyPath can import your existing Karabiner rules as editable KeyPath rule collections." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KeyPathは既存のKarabinerルールを、編集可能なKeyPathのルールコレクションとして読み込めます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KeyPath can turn on every required rule in the same change." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KeyPathは、必要なすべてのルールを同じ変更でオンにできます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KeyPath cannot check newly connected keyboards for Caps Lock rules right now. Existing keyboard rules keep working; check Settings > General." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KeyPathは現在、新しく接続されたキーボードのCaps Lockルールを確認できません。既存のキーボードのルールは引き続き動作します。設定 > 一般を確認してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KeyPath could no longer verify its Caps Lock mapping on the chosen keyboard, so it stopped and restored it. If another app changed Caps Lock, or a second identical keyboard is connected, fix that, then quit and reopen KeyPath." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選択したキーボードでCaps Lockのマッピングを確認できなくなったため、KeyPathは停止して元に戻しました。ほかのアプリがCaps Lockを変更した場合や、同じキーボードがもう1台接続されている場合は、それを解消してからKeyPathを終了して再度開いてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KeyPath could not check which of its processes are running. Nothing was removed. Try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KeyPathは実行中のプロセスを確認できませんでした。何も削除されていません。もう一度お試しください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KeyPath could not save that change. Nothing new was applied; try again or continue in Rules." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KeyPath could not save that change. Nothing new was applied; try again or continue in Rules."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KeyPath could not save that change. Nothing new was applied; try again." : {
      "comment" : "Recoverable error shown when an onboarding catalog install fails.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KeyPath could not save that change. Nothing new was applied; try again."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
