    "Off" : {
      "comment" : "Caps Lock rules status: turned off\nTyping sounds: no sound",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off · Rules that use Caps Lock won’t run" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフ · Caps Lockを使うルールは実行されません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: Hold resolves by timing, so holding a home-row key can become its modifier by itself.\n\nOn Press: Hold actions activate when you press a key with the other hand. Faster response, but more opinionated.\n\nOn Release: More forgiving — waits for the other-hand key to be released before committing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフ：長押しはタイミングで判定されるため、ホームロウのキーを押し続けるだけで修飾キーになることがあります。\n\n押下時：反対の手でキーを押すと長押しアクションが有効になります。反応は速いですが、挙動に癖があります。\n\n解放時：より寛容です。反対の手のキーが離されるまで待ってから確定します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On Hold" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On Hold"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "長押し時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On Press" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "押下時"
          }
        }
      }
