    "Terminal apps are usually in KindaVim's ignore list. To practice vim motions there, add `bindkey -v` to your ~/.zshrc to enable zsh's built-in vi mode, then turn on \"Show vim hints in terminal apps\" above." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
